# nopCommerce conventions

Match neighboring files. Do not introduce a new style.

- Service and plugin methods are async and end in `Async`.
- Types are `public partial class` / `public partial interface` unless a sibling is not.
- Resolve dependencies through constructors. In tests, use `GetService<T>()`.
- Query through `IRepository<T>` or existing services. Never concatenate untrusted input into SQL.
- Org-specific behavior belongs in `src/Plugins/` (new plugin or extension of an existing one). Edit `src/Libraries/` only when the change is truly platform-wide.
- New HTTP endpoints need tests in the matching `Nop.Web.Tests` or `Nop.Services.Tests` folder.

```csharp
// BAD — sync wrapper around existing async work
public decimal GetFee(IList<ShoppingCartItem> cart)
    => GetAdditionalHandlingFeeAsync(cart).GetAwaiter().GetResult();

// GOOD
public async Task<decimal> GetAdditionalHandlingFeeAsync(IList<ShoppingCartItem> cart)
    => await _orderTotalCalculationService.GetShoppingCartAdditionalShippingChargeAsync(cart);
```
